This project presents an interactive dashboard designed to analyze and visualize Counter-Strike match data, utilizing datasets from ESEA and Match Making. Developed using Python, Pandas, Plotly, and Dash, the tool allows users to track gameplay patterns, weapon preferences, and economic strategies. It features dynamic heatmaps for analyzing player positioning, specifically focusing on the de_mirage map. By providing detailed insights into metrics like bomb plant rates, utility usage, and win distributions across different round types, the dashboard empowers players to improve their tactical decision-making and gain a competitive edge.
